{"id":648,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"理数の思考と対話力を探究で伸ばす教育","feature_description":"順天堂大学系属理数インターは、理数的思考力とコミュニケーション力を基礎にした「理数インター」の学びを行います。数学的な考え方を鍛え、発表や対話を通じて自分の考えを伝える力を育成します。2025年度から中学1年・高校1年を対象に医学進学コースを設け、順天堂大学との系属校協定の枠組みで医療を含む学びにつなげています。探究やプレゼンテーションも教育活動に位置づけています。","clubs":[{"id":12031,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hosen.ed.jp/risu-inter/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12032,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hosen.ed.jp/risu-inter/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12033,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hosen.ed.jp/risu-inter/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12034,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hosen.ed.jp/risu-inter/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12035,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hosen.ed.jp/risu-inter/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12036,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hosen.ed.jp/risu-inter/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12037,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hosen.ed.jp/risu-inter/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12038,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hosen.ed.jp/risu-inter/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12039,"name":"バレーボール部（女子のみ）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hosen.ed.jp/risu-inter/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12040,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hosen.ed.jp/risu-inter/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12041,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hosen.ed.jp/risu-inter/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12042,"name":"自然科学研究部（天文部／生物部）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hosen.ed.jp/risu-inter/school-life/club/","verifi